# NLSY79 — Impatience proxy vs. BMI: results

## Headline (1989 BMI, composite impatience proxy)
- Adjusted OLS coefficient on composite-impatience indicator: **+0.681 BMI units**
- 95% CI: **[+0.348, +1.015]**, p = 6.4 × 10⁻⁵
- n = 8,359 (1,107 impatient / 7,252 other, after plausibility filter)
- Unadjusted mean diff: +0.248 (CI [−0.073, +0.568])

## Robustness (1989 BMI, savings-direction-only)
- Adjusted OLS coefficient on savings-direction indicator: **+0.472 BMI units**
- 95% CI: [+0.265, +0.678], p = 8.0 × 10⁻⁶
- n = 8,359 (5,942 impatient / 2,419 other)
- Unadjusted mean diff: +0.634 (CI [+0.452, +0.817])

